WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.630
Hi, Granduncle...

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:11.720
Thank you for coming, Senri.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:11.720
Come, this way.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.760
There's something

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.760
I want to show you today.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.720
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.720
What is it?

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.310
You're no longer a child.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.270
So there is something

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.270
that you must know,

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.940
as a member of the Shiki family.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.370
About this most important secret

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.370
which I have guarded so closely.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.620
For certain reasons,

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.620
I've been protecting him...

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.750
This is your father.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.520
You mean, he's not dead?

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.690
DEVIL'S AWAKENING

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.690
That's disgusting.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.110
DEVIL'S AWAKENING

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.110
What an awful thing

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.190
to say to your father.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.870
I've actually regenerated

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.870
quite a lot you know.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.540
Huh?

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.790
I've been looking forward

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.790
to seeing you all grown up.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:54.170
I'm sorry to keep you waiting...

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:54.170
my Lord.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.350
My beloved son...Senri...

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.560
Lend me your power...

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.740
Hmm...Which one should I choose?

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.580
This one.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.450
Again...

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.540
You're so easy to read, Rima.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.620
Huh?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.960
Old Maid is so boring

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.960
with just two people.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.170
Shiki should've come too.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.670
And you can beat Shiki, at least.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:39.970
That's not the only reason.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.510
I was wondering if

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.510
he's all right going home.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.680
Lord Kaname...

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.680
It seems they've begun to move.

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.270
Yes, I'm aware of that.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.520
You should've stayed asleep.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.480
Oh...

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:00.530
I'm going back to the dorm.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:11.370
If I become a vampire,

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:11.370
do you think I would feel stronger?

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.710
I said something terrible.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.750
To Zero, who's been suffering

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.750
since he became a vampire.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:27.850
Everyone has left...

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:27.850
back to their own homes.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.020
To their real parents.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.440
Somewhere in my heart...

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.520
there's an uneasiness about

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.520
the past which I cannot remember.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.990
Did my parents abandon me?

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.570
Who am I?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:49.700
Huh? Is that you, Yuki?

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.790
Oh...

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.040
Dinner will be ready in a minute,

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.040
so go and bathe first.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.830
Okay.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:02.920
From when was it...?

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.050
That the scary nights

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.050
became fewer and fewer.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:11.180
That's right...

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:11.180
It started after Zero came to this house.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:16.690
Since after I saw Zero so hurt

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:16.690
and feeling a need to protect him...

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.150
But I...

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:21.940
...didn't understand what Zero

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:21.940
was really suffering from.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.240
I won't let you become such a thing.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.660
Rather than protect him...

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.410
because I felt so uncertain

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.410
about not remembering...

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.500
I said such awful things...!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.710
I have to remember...

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.790
So that I don't hurt Zero

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.790
anymore than I have.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.210
I have to remember!

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.720
Yuki, you've been in there a long time.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.720
The Headmaster's worried.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:48.970
Are you all right?

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:50.600
U-Uh-huh...

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.060
Yuki, what's wrong?!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.480
Wh-What was that?

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:04.990
All that blood...

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.530
Hey Yuki... Are you all right?!

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.950
It's nothing. I'm coming out now.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.210
Okay, I'll wait outside.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.210
Sorry...but could you

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.210
stay a little longer?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.130
What's the matter?

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:33.010
I was trying hard to

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:33.010
remember my past...

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.810
Then...

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:39.560
You were abandoned

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:39.560
in a deserted place,

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:43.320
where vampires

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:43.320
wandered around, right?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:49.700
If your parents were Hunters

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:49.700
and got dragged into an incident,

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:50.780
that would make sense.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.240
But...the Headmaster said

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.240
there were no incidents like that.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:06:59.960
The Society's reports.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.960
If you read them yourself,

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.960
maybe you'll remember something.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.590
What'll you do?

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.430
Say, are you serious about this?

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.760
It's not the kind of place

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.760
I'd recommend.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.600
Zero, are you sure

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.600
it's okay for me to go?

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.980
You want to find out

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.980
for yourself, right?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.810
Uh-huh...

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:27.110
Well, I'm more worried about

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:27.110
Kiryu than you, Yuki.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.110
He is in a very sensitive situation

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.110
right now.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.240
They wouldn't kill me

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.240
the moment I walked in,

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.740
just because I'm a vampire now.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.450
That's true, but...

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:39.410
Why are you two

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:39.410
following us anyway?!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.750
This isn't a parent-child entrance exam!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.090
We're worried since

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.090
it's just the two of you...right?

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:46.590
Humph!

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.050
So what's the real reason you're going?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.970
I'm just going to snoop around...

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.350
And see what these jerks

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.350
from the Society are up to...

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.430
I hate this town.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.440
I can't even bad mouth

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.440
the Society without

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:03.520
constantly looking over my shoulder.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.820
I suppose, everyone who lives here

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.820
is a Vampire Hunter

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.030
or is somehow connected

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.030
to the Society.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.910
This is the Hunter's

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.910
Society Headquarters.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.660
Huh?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.700
They're not looking at you,

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.700
so don't worry.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.710
I have a bad feeling

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.710
about this place...

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.500
Be seeing you.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.090
Huh? Mr. Yagari!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.090
Where're you going?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.420
Maybe he's meeting up

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.420
with a girlfriend?

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:31.880
Impossible.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:38.260
Hmm... The building has

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:38.260
a spell to repel vampires...

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.680
Are you already domesticated?

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.560
Oh yeah, you've been branded.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:48.570
Just a minute, mister!

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:48.570
Is it fun teasing a youth at your age?!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.190
Hah! So this kid is the master?

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.820
Who're you calling "kid"?!

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.450
I think that's enough.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.120
Zero is truly one of us.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.540
As a Hunter, he was born into

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.540
that excellent Kiryu family.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:09.840
With his vampire powers,

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:09.840
he will be a valuable ally in time to come.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.920
It's been a long time, Society President.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:15.550
My, how you've grown, Zero.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.600
And? She's your girlfriend?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.680
Huh?!

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.270
I've come to take a look at

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.270
the Society's reports from ten years ago.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.100
Ten years ago?

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.690
I'd like to add my request as well.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:29.980
Hmm...

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:35.240
These things are closed to the public,

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:35.240
but if Cross insists...

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.950
I'm giving you special access to them.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:42.290
Hey, the Society President is

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:42.290
really important, isn't he?

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.500
How come the Headmaster

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.500
knows a big shot like that?

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.870
You haven't heard any of it then?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:51.460
Here is the archive.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:05.560
The history of the countless battles

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:05.560
between Hunters and vampires

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.640
lies asleep in here.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:10.860
Want to stop?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:17.360
No, I won't.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:17.360
I think it's better that I remember.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.820
It's just that...

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.820
I feel a bit nervous.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.790
Oh...

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.790
Zero, you come with me.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.830
We'll check the uncategorized data

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.830
over here.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.170
This area seems to hold the records

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.170
from ten years ago.

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:40.510
All right, here are the records from

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:40.510
about the time you were born, Yuki.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.260
If you take a look at them,

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.260
you may find out something.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.770
The data in this room

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.770
is rather illegible.

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:54.730
They were sent from battlegrounds

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:54.730
where there were casualties.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:11:02.740
All of them are soaked with

00:10:56.070 --> 00:11:02.740
the blood of our brethren.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.250
Why?!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.750
In a way, Zero is a victim

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.750
of the Hunter's Society!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.920
To send him into a night gala

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.920
filled with unpredictable vampires was...

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:21.260
And what was wrong with that?

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:21.260
Nothing happened, after all.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.890
And it would've been too late

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.890
if something had happened!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.560
Or, could you actually be waiting for

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.560
something to happen?

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.480
The final report from the site.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.480
"As ordered, three vampires

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.480
have been exterminated.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.780
"Postscript: As previously stated,

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.780
I'll start my side job

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.570
as my main profession

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.570
starting tomorrow.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:42.110
Please take care of things.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:42.110
Kaien Cross"

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.370
Huh?!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.780
Kaien Cross...?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:49.330
Oh...! That's a report

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:49.330
from sixteen years ago!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.250
Headmaster,

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.250
you were a Vampire Hunter?!

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.790
I'm sorry I couldn't

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.790
bring myself to tell you.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:12:01.090
I used to kill vampires long ago

00:11:55.500 --> 00:12:01.090
and I just didn't want you to know.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:06.600
Dad, no matter what, you're my dad.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:06.600
That doesn't change a thing.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.520
Yuki...!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.060
Geez, it's your fault for mixing

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.060
the reports from sixteen years ago.

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:15.060
What I'm looking for

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:15.060
is from ten years ago.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.070
You seem to be in a lot of pain.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.950
Have you begun to

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.950
lapse into Level E?

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.160
N-No... It's the smell of blood.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.540
Poor boy.

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.630
Oh, I know...

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.630
I'll teach you a secret.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:40.050
If you suck the blood of a Pureblood,

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:40.050
you can suppress your lapse into Level E.

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:45.840
You may get relief if you

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:45.840
get blood from Kaname Kuran.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:51.180
Naturally, that's if you can get it.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:56.810
If he won't give you any,

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:56.810
then take it from him.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.980
It's impossible for you right now,

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.780
but it's not like there's no way

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.780
to become stronger.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:09.700
You two are "The Cursed Twins" after all.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.120
The Cursed Twins?

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.000
What's wrong, Yuki?!

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.590
What's...?

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:26.130
I don't get it... I was about to

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:26.130
start reading when suddenly...

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:28.760
the page from that winter

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:28.760
ten years ago just...

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.020
Why?

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:43.150
It's as though something is trying to

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:43.150
prevent me from remembering the past...

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.950
My memories begin from that incident...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.910
What happened before that...?!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.790
I'm scared...

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.260
What...?!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.600
The Cursed Twins?

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.600
Who told you that?

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:18.100
The Society President...

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:18.100
and Ichiru the other night.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:25.110
It's a myth about twins who are

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:25.110
born into Vampire Hunter families.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.610
Although I don't know the reason.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.740
Oh, how's Yuki?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.910
She seems to have had quite a shock.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:38.500
I see... I guess that's to be expected.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:48.680
Twins aren't born into

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:48.680
Vampire Hunter families.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:54.850
Even if there are twins in the womb,

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:54.850
one will overtake the other.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:58.020
And only one will be born.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:00.980
The abominable curse of vampires.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.770
However, Zero and Ichiru were born.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.240
They probably shoulder

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.240
a greater curse.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.110
What are you trying to say?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:11.070
Nothing.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.990
I spoke with the top brass

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.990
at the Society.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.790
They seem to be

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.790
up to something, after all.

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.500
Just what do they plan to do?

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.460
Who is it?

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.920
Me. Can I come in?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:29.800
Uh-huh...

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:33.970
What's the matter?

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:42.440
U-Uhm... The thought that no one is

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:42.440
on campus made me feel a little sad...

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.910
That's not the truth, is it?

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.240
Huh?

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:57.080
You were thinking

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:57.080
about your memory--

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.160
about that page that burnt

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.160
at Society Headquarters.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:01.870
Uh-huh...

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.790
That wasn't normal...

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:10.630
I feel like something is interfering

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:10.630
with anything that happened ten years ago.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:18.220
I think someone erased

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:18.220
my memories in the first place.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.440
Huh?! Kaname...?

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.190
No way.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:27.770
But...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:34.070
I must confirm something

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:34.070
with Kaname.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.580
Oh, come on!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.580
Why do you look so worried?

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:47.130
Don't you like me

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:47.130
worrying about you?

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:48.920
Oh...

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.130
It's not that...

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:58.970
I don't want you to spend

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:58.970
the precious time you have

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.470
worrying about me.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.640
I don't want you to worry about me.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:09.730
I'm all right. So...

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.110
You have to think about yourself more...

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.320
Zero...

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:19.450
Yuki...

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.830
What is it?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.330
Oh...Ze...

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:39.970
Zero...

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:45.940
Why don't you resist?!

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:47.020
Huh?

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:50.440
The only way I can live is

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:50.440
to keep feeding on your blood!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.280
Don't you understand?!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.280
You're a victim, Yuki!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:56.530
Zero...

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:00.490
That's why, you have every right

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:00.490
to be cruel to me!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.410
No matter how much

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.410
you make me worry...

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.460
No matter what risky situations

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.460
you get me into, go and do as you like!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.380
But that's not enough

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.380
atonement from me...

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:16.220
Even if I use the rest of my life

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:16.220
for your sake... I have no complaints.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:28.520
I'm scared...!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.190
Just what is my past?!

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:46.250
I'm sorry you had to drop me off.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.170
No problem.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.170
My driver had come anyway.

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:54.130
But I'm nervous. Being summoned

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:54.130
by Grandfather like this...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.340
But what about you, Kaname?

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.340
Did anything happen?

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.020
I'll be back as soon as

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.020
I run my errand.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:06.770
Okay.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:08.770
Kaname!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.400
The Headmaster just told me...

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.030
You returned early.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.780
I had a yearning to see you.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.110
Here's a present.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:23.160
Huh? Oh, thank you.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.160
It's a rose that only blooms

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.160
once a decade preserved in resin.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:31.420
It's unusual, so I chose it on impulse.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.210
Would you have preferred

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.210
something to eat?

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:35.670
Huh?!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.590
Oh no... It's so pretty.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.340
I have a life-sized voodoo doll

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.340
for you, Zero.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.430
No thanks.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:51.600
Kaname, I must speak with you.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.610
Just the two of us?

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:56.230
Yes.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.440
Fine. I'll see you tonight.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.700
I'm okay. I feel refreshed

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.700
after crying all night.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.840
Lord Kaname, you're back early.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.210
Yes, I have some urgent business.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.380
Thank you for

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.380
your hospitality at the villa.

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.590
Please, don't mention it.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:31.430
What were you searching for

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:31.430
in this room?

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:37.320
I want...to know...

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:37.320
what you are planning, Lord Kaname.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.230
It would be wise not to

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.230
delve any further than this.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.160
Will you tell me?!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:44.530
Tell you what?

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:50.660
Why your parents... Why Lord

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:50.660
and Lady Kuran killed themselves.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:55.420
I wondered if...that had something

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:55.420
to do with what you're doing.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:20:59.460
It wasn't a suicide.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:01.880
They were murdered.

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:03.260
Huh?!

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:08.350
Your Pureblood parents were killed?!

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:08.350
Who would do such a thing?!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.470
I can't go any further than that...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.470
right now.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.980
Don't risk your life over it.

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:16.270
I want to be of help to you!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:17.360
I just told you...

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.070
I can't say any more than that.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.280
I beg your pardon.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.910
But please remember...

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.910
that I want to be of help to you.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.370
Aido...

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:37.540
I expected you to think that I was

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:37.540
the one who killed my parents.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.510
To be honest, I'm happy that

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.510
you didn't think that way.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.430
You returned promptly.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:55.430
I didn't want to trouble the others

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:55.430
with your presence again.

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:59.400
You must know the duties of

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:59.400
the Ichijo family who serve as Senate.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:02.900
And I raised you this way because

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:02.900
I have high hopes for you.

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.990
Grandfather, I...

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:09.780
There's someone I want you to meet.

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:09.780
That's why I summoned you here.

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:19.000
Pardon me for keeping you waiting.

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:22.210
How are you feeling...my Lord?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:25.510
Not bad.

00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:05.730
Next time:

00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:05.730
"The Subordinate's Trap"
